d. one (1) advance visit for the purpose of securing suitable housi

answer:
The answer can be found in Article 6.50 of the Collective Agreement.

According to Article 6.50:

6.50.1 Moving expenses include:
a. moving, packing, crating and unpacking of household goods and personal effects;
b. transfer of family by the most economical means of transportation;

Therefore, for economical transportation, the most economical means would apply to transfer of family members.

